    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Murphy & Sons Auctioneers are delighted to present Apartment 1, Cois In Bhear to the market, a three-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment enjoying beautiful views over the Garavogue River and Sligo Harbour.  The accommodation is bright and well proportioned throughout.  The living/dining \r\narea features floor length windows, allowing an abundance of natural light to fill the room while taking full advantage of the attractive views.\r\nThis space is finished with laminate flooring.  From the living area, there is access to the fully fitted kitchen, which features tiled flooring and splashback along with storage and worktop space.  \r\n\r\nThe apartment comprises three well-proportioned double bedrooms, one of which benefits from its own en suite, while the remaining bedrooms are served by a shared main bathroom.  \r\n\r\nA standout feature of this property is its own designated parking space within the secure undergound car park.  The location is particularly\r\nconvenient, with Sligo Town Centre approximately a five-minute walk away, providing an extensive range of shops, cafes, restaurants, schools, and sports and recreational amenities.  Sligo Bus Station and Train Station are also within walking distance, while a local bus stop is situated just one\r\nminute from the property.\r\n\r\nWith spacious accommodation, secure underground parking, impressive views and an excellent location close to Sligo Town Centre, Apartment 1, Cois In Bhear offers an attractive opportunity for a wide range of purchasers.\r\n\r\nTo arrange a viewing, contact Murphy & Sons on 071-9142118"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - \r\nCarpet Flooring\nHot press\r\n\r\nKitchen - 3.03m x 2.59m \r\nFully fitted kitchen with integrated oven, hob and extractor fan.\nTiled flooring and splasback.\r\n\r\nLiving/Diningroom - 7.91m x 4.75m \r\nLaminate wood flooring throughout.\nGenerous front facing window with beautiful views of the Garavogue  River and Sligo Harbour.\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.67m x 3.14m \r\nDouble Room\nLaminate wood flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.74m x 2.78m \r\nDouble Room\nLaminate wood flooring\nEnsuite: (1.37 m x 2.52 m)\nTiled floor to ceiling.\nWC & WHB \nShower.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.58m x 3.57m \r\nDouble room\nLaminate wood flooring\r\n\r\nBathroom - 3.16m x 1.88m \r\nTiled floor to ceiling\nWC & WHB\nShower over bath\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
